{"id":"0e6490247e9b201ca3166711e820d8f4b60680ad","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56619","title":"刚刚，Claude爆改语音！11种语言，就是没中文 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-07-25 15:00 分享","excerpt":"Anthropic与OpenAI同步升级语音功能：Claude语音模式升至Opus 4.8和Sonnet 5，支持Gmail、日历、Slack等工具调用，覆盖11种语言（不含中文）；OpenAI推出全双工GPT-Live，登陆macOS与Windows桌面，可语音同时调度多个Agent，且明确支持中文。双方均强化语音交互能力与多工具协同，但语言支持策略不同——Claude暂未纳入中文，而OpenAI优先适配中文用户。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2ac15ce41f48a917fdb656bac03af7531784962801796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.425531914893617\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2350\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"246\" data-imgfileid=\"505231026\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/2ac15ce41f48a917fdb656bac03af7531784962801796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71784962801797.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"40\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505218218\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71784962801797.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92eyb1ysr\"><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31oif\"><span leaf=\"\">刚刚，Anthropic和OpenAI同时放出了语音模式大升级！</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3fcz\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude这边</span><span textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">从只能跑Haiku升级到Opus 4.8和Sonnet 5全系列<span textstyle=\"\">，不仅能在对话里调Gmail、日历、Slack，还扩增到11种语言，但</span><span textstyle=\"\">没有中文</span><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"167\" data-backw=\"562\" data-height=\"283\" data-imgfileid=\"505231011\" data-ratio=\"0.29758149316508936\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/13481a29003d65b05d2ec0f0bbe26e211784962801797.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"951\" data-width=\"951\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/13481a29003d65b05d2ec0f0bbe26e211784962801797.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3216c\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI那边</span><span textstyle=\"\">，</span></span><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3216c\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;mpa-font-style&quot;:&quot;mry92ue3216c&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\">全双工GPT-Live</span></span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">直接搬上了</span>macOS和Windows<span textstyle=\"\">桌面，动动嘴就同时指挥一整队Agent，并且</span><span textstyle=\"\">支持中文</span><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4f7941ae12c6bab89b203f6d0bf97b9e1784962801798.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6645962732919255\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"966\" data-width=\"966\" data-height=\"642\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"374\" data-imgfileid=\"505231013\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4f7941ae12c6bab89b203f6d0bf97b9e1784962801798.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801798.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801798.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">Claude Voice大升级</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31s87\"><span textstyle=\"\">在此之前，Claude的语音模式只能跑Haiku，也就是最小的那个模型。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3l7i\"><span textstyle=\"\">你跟它语音聊天，它能听懂，但稍微复杂一点的问题就容易翻车。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3lwd\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">现在，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Opus 4.8和Sonnet 5</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">都上了。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3132d\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你可以在对话中途切换模型。系统自动调用所选模型的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">最快版本</span><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">注意，是最快版本，不是完整推理版本。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7e7e987aa308b02b46154fd6eda4af771784962801798.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.8795430944963655\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"963\" data-width=\"963\" data-height=\"847\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"494\" data-imgfileid=\"505231014\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7e7e987aa308b02b46154fd6eda4af771784962801798.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\"><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3n67\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">好消息是，语音模式会</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">默认加载你上次文字聊天用的模型</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，文字和语音之间上下文不断，无缝来回切。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31004\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">交互方面，则有两种模式：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Hands-free</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">持续监听自动回复，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Push-to-talk</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">按住说话松手结束。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31uri\"><span textstyle=\"\">当然，要说最重要的，那还得是「</span><span textstyle=\"\">工具调用</span><span textstyle=\"\">」。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31b2b\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">语音对话中，Claude现在可以直接连接你的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Gmail、Google Calendar、Slack、Google Docs、Canva</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3ymn\"><span textstyle=\"\">说一句话，它替你翻邮件、查日历、读文档、发消息。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3mi3\"><span textstyle=\"\">Anthropic的产品经理Robert Bye举了几个例子：</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>帮我总结Slack过去几小时我错过了什么。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·</span>&#160;把新项目PRD的摘要发给Slack上的Nick。</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3iie\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYUYuWjFb7zkoNSqricET9Ddt9ZbEOwicBdlQkAcvNDbhFC8jbjV5BcxFLAibXuROv44geY0NF6Y1R3icLticdhEzGfgBjRFuWlAMS0E/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-src=\"\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"958\" data-height=\"546\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505231005\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">嘴上说完，活就干了。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7d3d9035599dbe5aada4bb0d5dc482b51784962801798.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.569937369519833\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"958\" data-width=\"958\" data-height=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"505231019\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7d3d9035599dbe5aada4bb0d5dc482b51784962801798.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31hzh\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">技术上，语音里的工具调用和文字聊天走的是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">同一套Connectors架构</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，不是阉割版，每次调用前还会先问你要许可。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31ezo\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">所有套餐都能用，但免费用户只有Haiku加1个连接器，Opus全套得氪金。用量从</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">常规额度里扣</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，今天起全平台公测推送。</span></span></span></p><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1784962801798.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1784962801798.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">11种语言，没有中文</span></strong></span></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3tif\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">语言方面，Claude语音模式这次支持了</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">11种语言</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">：英语、法语、德语、印地语、印尼语、意大利语、日语、韩语、巴西葡萄牙语、拉美西班牙语、欧洲西班牙语。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31yr2\"><span textstyle=\"\">从头找到尾看一遍，没有中文。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue321ub\"><span textstyle=\"\">对这部分用户来说，还是得继续打字。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mry9byxy13av\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c42918c556736caba7d0c55b9f9553211784962801799.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.8502824858757063\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"354\" data-width=\"354\" data-height=\"655\" data-backw=\"354\" data-backh=\"655\" data-imgfileid=\"505231017\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c42918c556736caba7d0c55b9f9553211784962801799.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31ie7\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而且Claude</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不会自动检测你说的是什么语言</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3crz\"><span textstyle=\"\">你得主动开口让它切，比如「请用日语跟我说话」，或者去设置里手动选。不切的话，默认是英语。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue314v1\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">有意思的是，此前有开发者从Claude App的代码中扒出过一份语言列表，包含18种语言，其中明确写着</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Chinese</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYVRzd2T75X1F3TUYSZh20cwhwAMcflq0Gzzy5bib5jvaHhh18UeGhS7EvJ0g6LFo96QQbl06YiaxA5yC9vMVibuCDzyScfoAMQmiac/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-src=\"\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"1063\" data-height=\"1345\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505231010\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31sfa\"><span textstyle=\"\">结果，18种变11种，中文直接被砍了。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fd3759cfd2b32d063c82e69674bb081d1784962801799.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.2652869238005644\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1063\" data-width=\"1063\" data-height=\"1345\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"711\" data-imgfileid=\"505231020\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/fd3759cfd2b32d063c82e69674bb081d1784962801799.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801799.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801799.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT Voice杀入桌面</span></strong></span></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31v53\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">相比之下，ChatGPT的语音则是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">从底层换了一套全新的架构</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31sjo\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它用的是7月8日刚发布的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-Live</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，一个全双工语音模型。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3bnx\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">所谓全双工就是，模型能够同时处理输入和输出音频流，并且</span></span><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3bnx\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;mpa-font-style&quot;:&quot;mry92ue3bnx&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;strong&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\">每秒做出几十次判断</span><span textstyle=\"\">，</span></span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">不用等你说完就能回应</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31rvq\"><span textstyle=\"\">所以GPT-Live会在你说话中间「嗯嗯」「明白了」，像活人在听。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3nx5\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">更进一步来看，它基于的是一个</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">双层架构</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue35qk\"><span textstyle=\"\">前台是一个轻量低延迟的语音模型，负责实时对话、轮次管理、打断响应，所有需要毫秒级反应的事。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3su2\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">后台是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-5.5</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，负责复杂推理、网页搜索、Agent任务。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31zu0\"><span textstyle=\"\">当你问一个需要深度思考的问题，GPT-Live会把任务异步委派给后台的GPT-5.5，然后自己继续跟你聊，等结果出来了再汇报。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31hzm\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI管这个叫</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYWJ55hwz6wXVAibhk2AhatAkAzFhMkf2kmicJ6TqQkatm9SQmLIEpibkicAg57SJjDhRq6nT527AkrwxtOxfaDic4GcQ13TLRw46GGk/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-src=\"\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"1429\" data-height=\"465\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505231006\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「委派推理」（Delegated Reasoning）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/10b3c50aaea77c73e17d893176c450d51784962801799.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.3254023792862141\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1429\" data-width=\"1429\" data-height=\"465\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"183\" data-imgfileid=\"505231016\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/10b3c50aaea77c73e17d893176c450d51784962801799.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue310p5\"><span textstyle=\"\">具体来说就是，OpenAI把对话延迟和推理深度，被彻底解耦了。你不需要等大模型想完才能继续说话。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3155l\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">推理深度还能调三档：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Instant</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">最快，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Medium</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">中等推理，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">High</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">深度推理，分别对应GPT-5.5的不同档位。免费用户用的是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-Live-1 mini</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue37z7\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">从跑分来看，这个委派架构是真的管用，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">语音模式终于不再是「降级版聊天」了。</span></span></strong></span></p><ul><li><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3hg8\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPQA（专家级科学推理）从此前高级语音模式的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">45.3%跳到84.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3ubw\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">BrowseComp（Agent网页搜索能力）从</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">0.7%飙到75.2%</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue323e7\"><span textstyle=\"\">模拟真实多轮电信客服场景的τ³-Voice Telecom基准，GPT-Live也全面碾压。</span></span></p></li></ul><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">嘴上说着，多个Agent同时跑</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3r6u\"><span textstyle=\"\">有了这套底子，OpenAI直接把它搬上了桌面。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3e08\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">从今天起，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">ChatGPT Voice正式登陆macOS和Windows桌面端。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3ogs\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">你可以设一个</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">全局快捷键</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，在任何应用里一键唤起ChatGPT Voice。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31x59\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">macOS上还有</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYXxKXbDBYiaNkDuDic4y5oBdhus0BODBOkicYork7QZgpwvTOaYm83u29mQVAiaoicyVYy11hFWRt2nFnH7WUia37QEdnbeL8K4Y5LuU/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-src=\"\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"1606\" data-height=\"1202\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505231015\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Appshots功能</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，ChatGPT可以直接读取你当前活跃窗口的内容，作为对话的上下文。</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31x59\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">比如，对着Excel说「帮我算一下Q3同比」时，它能看得到你的表格。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1d0a93619952821b048b790beca218831784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7484433374844334\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1606\" data-width=\"1606\" data-height=\"1202\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"421\" data-imgfileid=\"505231024\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1d0a93619952821b048b790beca218831784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31ik0\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">此外，你还可以用语音指挥ChatGPT Work和Codex里的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">多个Agent同时工作</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue314n6\"><span textstyle=\"\">一边让一个Agent写代码，一边让另一个Agent查文档，嘴上说着就行。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue35lg\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-Live在前台跟你说话，后台同时启动、检查、切换多个工作线程，不需要你回到键盘前。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31ce7\"><span textstyle=\"\">目前，Plus、Pro、Business、Edu、Enterprise套餐可用。</span></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">10秒钟就能感受到的差距</span></strong></span></section><ul><li><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31efi\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">能不能打断</span></span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3vfh\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude语音是轮流制，你说完它才想。想插嘴？等着。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3sw9\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-Live可以被打断。你说到一半改主意了，它立刻停下来跟上你新的想法。打断前说到哪儿，它还记得。</span></span></p><ul><li><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue324or\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">能不能一心多用</span></span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31mdb\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude一次只做一件事——语音聊天。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31l8j\"><span textstyle=\"\">ChatGPT Voice在桌面端可以一边跟你说话，一边在后台操控电脑、指挥多个Agent各干各的。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31231\"><span textstyle=\"\">「帮我开个PR，同时查一下昨天的CI日志」，两件事可以同时开始跑。</span></span></p><ul><li><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31d3q\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">能不能动手</span></span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue324za\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude语音可以通过连接器调用Gmail、日历</span><span textstyle=\"\">这些SaaS工具，但它</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">摸不到你的桌面</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3161i\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">ChatGPT Voice在桌面端配合Computer Use，可以</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">直接操控你的电脑</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。文</span><span textstyle=\"\">件、程序、终端，它都能碰。</span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><strong mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31fd9\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">想得有多深</span></span></strong></p></li></ul><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31rq8\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude的底牌是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Opus 4.8</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，在多步推理和知识综合类任务上依然是最强模型之一。但语音模式跑的是Opus的最快版本，不是满血推理版。</span></span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3bih\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-Live这边，High档可以异步委派给</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-5.5 Thinking</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">做深度推理，反而能在语音场景下调用接近满血的推理能力。</span></span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mryaxaw2uj9\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/479ab940d1661f88f01b156d3b62cab01784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1086\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"771\" data-imgfileid=\"505231033\" data-aistatus=\"2\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/479ab940d1661f88f01b156d3b62cab01784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">连输入框都不需要的时代</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3240l\"><span textstyle=\"\">看到这儿，两家的分岔就清楚了。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3tm6\"><span textstyle=\"\">轮流制的Claude，主打的是用你自己的Gmail、日历、文档，帮你把自己那摊事理明白。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31awr\"><span textstyle=\"\">全双工的GPT-Live，主打的是像在跟一个人说话。可打断、可多线程、可操控电脑，让你忘记对面是AI。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31vjv\"><span textstyle=\"\">对不写代码的人来说，Claude门槛低得多，有邮件要理、日程要排，张嘴就行。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue31uus\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI那条路更爽也更极客，你手里得先真有一队Agent、有真活给它们干。</span></span></p><p><span mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue3pxk\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">正如Greg Brockman所说，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「比起语音，</span><span textstyle=\"\">打字这件事本来就特别不自然</span><span textstyle=\"\">。」</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mry92ue313db\"><span textstyle=\"\">那把陪了人类四十年的塑料按键，如今正式被OpenAI和Anthropic同时逼到了墙角。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/34c3597d8625ec97ca60d103c0696c161784962801800.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.16493775933609958\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"964\" data-width=\"964\" data-height=\"159\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"93\" data-imgfileid=\"505231022\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/34c3597d8625ec97ca60d103c0696c161784962801800.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2080401533728940372</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2080378182469857576</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2080385285951521150</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/claudeai/status/2080376094939603366</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://claude.com/blog/think-through-hard-problems-in-voice-mode</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：摩西</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1784962801801.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1784962801801.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01784962801801.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01784962801801.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 刚刚，Anthropic和OpenAI同时放出了语音模式大升级！Claude这边，从只能跑Haiku升级到Opus 4.8和Sonnet 5全系列，不仅能在对话里调Gmail、日历、Slack，还扩增到11种语言，但没有中文。OpenAI那边，全双工GPT-Live直接搬上了macOS和Windows桌面，动动嘴就同时指挥一整队Agent，并且支持中文。Claude Voice大升级在此之前，Claude的语音模式只能跑Haiku，也就是最小的那个模型。你跟它语音聊天，它能听懂，但稍微复杂一点的问题就容易翻车。现在，Opus 4.8和Sonnet 5都上了。你可以在对话中途切换模型。系统自动调用所选模型的最快版本。注意，是最快版本，不是完整推理版本。好消息是，语音模式会默认加载你上次文字聊天用的模型，文字和语音之间上下文不断，无缝来回切。交互方面，则有两种模式：Hands-free持续监听自动回复，Push-to-talk按住说话松手结束。当然，要说最重要的，那还得是「工具调用」。语音对话中，Claude现在可以直接连接你的Gmail、Google Calendar、Slack、Google Docs、Canva。说一句话，它替你翻邮件、查日历、读文档、发消息。Anthropic的产品经理Robert Bye举了几个例子：· 帮我总结Slack过去几小时我错过了什么。· 把新项目PRD的摘要发给Slack上的Nick。嘴上说完，活就干了。技术上，语音里的工具调用和文字聊天走的是同一套Connectors架构，不是阉割版，每次调用前还会先问你要许可。所有套餐都能用，但免费用户只有Haiku加1个连接器，Opus全套得氪金。用量从常规额度里扣，今天起全平台公测推送。11种语言，没有中文语言方面，Claude语音模式这次支持了11种语言：英语、法语、德语、印地语、印尼语、意大利语、日语、韩语、巴西葡萄牙语、拉美西班牙语、欧洲西班牙语。从头找到尾看一遍，没有中文。对这部分用户来说，还是得继续打字。而且Claude不会自动检测你说的是什么语言。你得主动开口让它切，比如「请用日语跟我说话」，或者去设置里手动选。不切的话，默认是英语。有意思的是，此前有开发者从Claude App的代码中扒出过一份语言列表，包含18种语言，其中明确写着Chinese。结果，18种变11种，中文直接被砍了。ChatGPT Voice杀入桌面相比之下，ChatGPT的语音则是从底层换了一套全新的架构。它用的是7月8日刚发布的GPT-Live，一个全双工语音模型。所谓全双工就是，模型能够同时处理输入和输出音频流，并且每秒做出几十次判断，不用等你说完就能回应。所以GPT-Live会在你说话中间「嗯嗯」「明白了」，像活人在听。更进一步来看，它基于的是一个双层架构。前台是一个轻量低延迟的语音模型，负责实时对话、轮次管理、打断响应，所有需要毫秒级反应的事。后台是GPT-5.5，负责复杂推理、网页搜索、Agent任务。当你问一个需要深度思考的问题，GPT-Live会把任务异步委派给后台的GPT-5.5，然后自己继续跟你聊，等结果出来了再汇报。OpenAI管这个叫「委派推理」（Delegated Reasoning）。具体来说就是，OpenAI把对话延迟和推理深度，被彻底解耦了。你不需要等大模型想完才能继续说话。推理深度还能调三档：Instant最快，Medium中等推理，High深度推理，分别对应GPT-5.5的不同档位。免费用户用的是GPT-Live-1 mini。从跑分来看，这个委派架构是真的管用，语音模式终于不再是「降级版聊天」了。GPQA（专家级科学推理）从此前高级语音模式的45.3%跳到84.2%。BrowseComp（Agent网页搜索能力）从0.7%飙到75.2%。模拟真实多轮电信客服场景的τ³-Voice Telecom基准，GPT-Live也全面碾压。嘴上说着，多个Agent同时跑有了这套底子，OpenAI直接把它搬上了桌面。从今天起，ChatGPT Voice正式登陆macOS和Windows桌面端。你可以设一个全局快捷键，在任何应用里一键唤起ChatGPT Voice。macOS上还有Appshots功能，ChatGPT可以直接读取你当前活跃窗口的内容，作为对话的上下文。比如，对着Excel说「帮我算一下Q3同比」时，它能看得到你的表格。此外，你还可以用语音指挥ChatGPT Work和Codex里的多个Agent同时工作。一边让一个Agent写代码，一边让另一个Agent查文档，嘴上说着就行。GPT-Live在前台跟你说话，后台同时启动、检查、切换多个工作线程，不需要你回到键盘前。目前，Plus、Pro、Business、Edu、Enterprise套餐可用。10秒钟就能感受到的差距能不能打断Claude语音是轮流制，你说完它才想。想插嘴？等着。GPT-Live可以被打断。你说到一半改主意了，它立刻停下来跟上你新的想法。打断前说到哪儿，它还记得。能不能一心多用Claude一次只做一件事——语音聊天。ChatGPT Voice在桌面端可以一边跟你说话，一边在后台操控电脑、指挥多个Agent各干各的。「帮我开个PR，同时查一下昨天的CI日志」，两件事可以同时开始跑。能不能动手Claude语音可以通过连接器调用Gmail、日历这些SaaS工具，但它摸不到你的桌面。ChatGPT Voice在桌面端配合Computer Use，可以直接操控你的电脑。文件、程序、终端，它都能碰。想得有多深Claude的底牌是Opus 4.8，在多步推理和知识综合类任务上依然是最强模型之一。但语音模式跑的是Opus的最快版本，不是满血推理版。GPT-Live这边，High档可以异步委派给GPT-5.5 Thinking做深度推理，反而能在语音场景下调用接近满血的推理能力。连输入框都不需要的时代看到这儿，两家的分岔就清楚了。轮流制的Claude，主打的是用你自己的Gmail、日历、文档，帮你把自己那摊事理明白。全双工的GPT-Live，主打的是像在跟一个人说话。可打断、可多线程、可操控电脑，让你忘记对面是AI。对不写代码的人来说，Claude门槛低得多，有邮件要理、日程要排，张嘴就行。OpenAI那条路更爽也更极客，你手里得先真有一队Agent、有真活给它们干。正如Greg Brockman所说，「比起语音，打字这件事本来就特别不自然。」那把陪了人类四十年的塑料按键，如今正式被OpenAI和Anthropic同时逼到了墙角。参考资料：https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2080401533728940372https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2080378182469857576https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2080385285951521150https://x.com/claudeai/status/2080376094939603366https://claude.com/blog/think-through-hard-problems-in-voice-mode编辑：摩西秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-07-26T07:00:11.194Z","ok":true}